  "body": "Nestled in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this tastefully renovated waterfront home offers an unparalleled lifestyle opportunity with a large family home and a generous fully self-contained unit ideal for extended family or income.\r\n\r\nSpanning 1,415 sqm of prime land with Riparian Rights, the property runs right down to the water's edge, offering unobstructed views of the Tamaki Estuary and beyond to Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf. If kayaking or fishing is your thing, then you can do this from your front yard.\r\n\r\nThe home itself is a magnificent solid concrete masonry construction, designed to last for generations. With three expansive levels, you will enjoy panoramic vistas from almost every room. Excellent sunlight pours into the home throughout the day, creating a bright and inviting environment, throughout this extensive home.\r\n\r\nMultiple living areas ensure there's space for everyone, and an impressive new entertainers’ kitchen with well-known branded appliances, adjacent to the family dining area is enjoyed by family and friends alike.  Outdoors offers several BBQ spots to further entertain and enjoy, while admiring the extensive water views.\r\n\r\nAlso, the main home features five spacious bedrooms, three luxurious recently renovated bathrooms, including two ensuite bathrooms and a downstairs living area ideal for teenagers or guests.\r\n\r\nA separate two-bedroom unit with its own private courtyard, stunning views, and carport offers extra privacy and versatility - ideal for extended family, an Airbnb or a permanent rental income.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional property is perfectly located within the sought-after school zones for Pigeon Mountain School, Wakaaranga School, Farm Cove Intermediate, and Pakuranga College - and is within a short drive of Saint Kentigern College for those choosing private education. \r\n\r\nLocated close to the Half Moon Bay Marina and shopping centre, offering the option of a convenient commute to Auckland’s CBD by ferry daily, if required.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this unique opportunity of securing a rare waterfront gem, in one of Half Moon Bay’s most desirable cul-de-sacs. Phone now to arrange your private viewing.",
